cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Prokron in your work, please cite it.
title: "Prokron: project management that a person and an AI can both read"
abstract: >-
  Prokron keeps people and AI agents working from the same project state. A
  project's phases, tasks, dependencies, decisions and definition of done live
  as Markdown inside its repository, and a deterministic compiler turns those
  documents into project state, projected as a dashboard for a person and as a
  context packet for an agent.
type: software
authors:
